### Summary Table: Strength vs. Power in Running
| Feature | Traditional Strength | Rewired Power (RFD) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Movement** | Slow, precise, heavy | Fast, explosive, snappy |
| **Goal** | Move a heavy object | Apply force instantly |
| **Result** | Muscle mass / force | Stride efficiency / speed |